# {{.Name}}

A PagerOS list/detail starter — `List` + `ListItem`, query-param-based detail route.

## Run

```sh
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```

Routes:
- `GET /` — list of items
- `GET /item?id=<key>` — detail for the chosen item
